@page "/docs/components/toggle"
@using Blaizio.Docs.Examples.Toggle
<PageTitle>Toggle - Blaizio</PageTitle>

<div class="typeset typeset-docs space-y-10">
    <header class="docs-page-header space-y-2.5">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
            <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Toggle</h1>
            <DocBadges Slug="toggle" />
        </div>
        <p>A two-state button for a single on or off setting, such as bold text. It manages its own pressed state unless you bind it, and it reports that state to assistive technology through <code>aria-pressed</code>. For a set of related toggles, use Toggle Group.</p>
    </header>

    <UsageBlock Example="typeof(ToggleDefaultExample)" Description="Put an icon or text inside the toggle. Without a binding, it keeps track of its own pressed state." />

    <ExamplesHeading />

    <Demo Title="Default" Description="With no binding, the toggle switches its pressed state on every press." Example="typeof(ToggleDefaultExample)" />

    <Demo Title="Custom element (RenderAs)"
          Description="Use `RenderAs` when the toggle should be your own element, such as the anchor here, and apply `p.Attributes` to it. The element then carries the toggle behavior and pressed state."
          Example="typeof(ToggleRenderAsExample)" />

    <Demo Title="Outline" Example="typeof(ToggleOutlineExample)" />

    <Demo Title="With text" Example="typeof(ToggleTextExample)" />

    <Demo Title="Sizes" Example="typeof(ToggleSizesExample)" />

    <Demo Title="Disabled" Example="typeof(ToggleDisabledExample)" />

    <Demo Title="Controlled" Description="Bind the pressed state to a field in your page when other code needs to read or change it. Here the label next to the toggle follows the bound value." Example="typeof(ToggleControlledExample)" />

    <Demo Title="Customization"
          Description="Every part accepts `Class`. This example recolors the pressed state with `aria-pressed:` utilities."
          Example="typeof(ToggleCustomExample)" />

    <Demo Title="RTL" Description="Inside a right-to-left `DirectionProvider`, the icon sits on the leading edge of the text, which is now the right side." Example="typeof(ToggleRtlExample)" />
</div>

